      "writtenOn": "2021-12-07T14:56:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If we don\u0027t closeProfileProxy, this ServiceListener would automatically bind to bluetooth service if bluetooth service is available, then we would receive unexpected onServiceConnected even user to call startTetherng(bluetooth).\n\nThe BluetoothPan hold a BluetoothProfileConnector object which would listen bluetooth intent. If profile(BluetoothPan) is not close, it would automatically reconnect to pan service when it become from unavailable to available.",
