      "message": "Why is it likely? When can this happen? If the tethering thread just got onServiceConnected, then it\u0027s pretty likely that bluetooth is *not* disconnected, right?\n\nDid you mean \"It can happen that due to a race condition, the bluetooth service has already disconnected when onServiceConnected is called.\"?",
